/**
 * swe.ch7.l3 — تدفقات البيانات وربط العملاء بالخوادم /
 *              Dataflow and Client-Server Patterns
 * SWE ch7 — s4 Dataflow Architectures (ص184-187 / pp.184-187) + s5 Connecting
 * Clients with Servers (ص188-193 / pp.188-193).
 * Runnable design: a deterministic pipe-filter pipeline over a fixed list with
 * per-stage prints, plus a mini request/response round-trip table simulation.
 * Deterministic only: no input(), no exit(), no random, no unittest.main.
 */
