      solution: 'NUMS = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]\n\ndef keep_evens(xs):\n    return [x for x in xs if x % 2 == 0]\n\ndef double(xs):\n    return [x * 2 for x in xs]\n\ndef total(xs):\n    return sum(xs)\n\nstage1 = keep_evens(NUMS)\nstage2 = double(stage1)\nstage3 = total(stage2)\nprint("evens:", stage1)\nprint("doubled:", stage2)\nprint("total:", stage3)\n',
